<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean NLCF to seek 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korean NLCF to seek 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) will invite tenders to buy 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat by 11.30 local time (0230 GMT) on Tuesday, an NLCF official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The official said arrival was set for Inchon and one of three ports -- Ulsan, Pusan or Kunsan.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>  POSITION  TONNE		    SHIPMENT		  ETA</p>
<p>  One	 52,500  U.S. Gulf/Europe   PNW/Canada/Aus  Mar 5</p>
<p>			  Jan 14-Feb 2	 Feb 2-Feb 21</p>
<p>  Two	 52,500  U.S. Gulf/Europe   PNW/Canada/Aus  June 15</p>
<p>			  Apr 26-May 15	May 15-Jun 3</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
